  <entity00164779:DescriptionOfChangesInTheNumberOfSharesSubjectToExchangeOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">최초 발행 시 교환대상 주식수는 20,126,911주였으나, 교환권 행사 및 교환가액 조정에 따라 교환대상 주식수 변동이 발생하여 당반기말 기준 교환대상 주식수는 20,139,289주입니다.</entity00164779:DescriptionOfChangesInTheNumberOfSharesSubjectToExchangeOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <entity00164779:CallOptionByTheIssuerBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2028년 4월 25일 부터 사채만기일 30 영업일 전까지 30 연속거래일 중 20 거래일의 종가가 교환가격의 130% 이상인 경우.
미상환사채잔액이 총 발행총액의 10% 미만인 경우(Clean Up Call).
관련 법령의 개정 등으로 인한 추가 조세부담사유가 발생하는 경우.</entity00164779:CallOptionByTheIssuerBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <entity00164779:PutOptionByTheInvestorBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">납입일로부터 4년 (2027. 04. 11)이 되는 날.
지배기업의 지배권 변동(Change of Control)이 발생하는 경우.
