  <entity00164779:DescriptionOfCashAndCashEquivalentsAndOthersOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" xml:lang="ko">현금및현금성자산, 단기금융상품 및 단기투자자산의 합계액입니다.</entity00164779:DescriptionOfCashAndCashEquivalentsAndOthersOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioTableOfItems>
