/ 행사일 주가 (*1),(*3)</entity00164779:NumberOfSharesGrantedFromShareBasedPaymentArrangementOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems>
  <entity00164779:NumberOfSharesGrantedFromShareBasedPaymentArrangementOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00164779_One2NdMemberOfStockSettlementBasedShareBasedPaymentArrangementMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">최초부여규모 * TSR * 조정비율
