2) 조기상환 : 회사의 조기상환권(Call Option) 및 사채권자의 조기상환권(Put Option) 존재</entity00164779:PrincipalPaymentMethodBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
